# Oryx (ScarlettNative)

> **Research-driven native x86-64 execution environment & Microsoft GDK compatibility runtime for Xbox Series X|S software on Windows 11.**  
> *It is not an emulator.*

[![Language](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-C%2B%2B23-blue.svg)](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/23)
[![Platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-Windows%2011%20x86--64-0078D6.svg)](https://www.microsoft.com/windows)
