## 8. Research Disclaimer & Compliance

Oryx is an independent research and development project focused on operating system compatibility, binary translation, and Microsoft GDK interoperability. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft Corporation. All registered trademarks, product names, and brand logos belong to their respective owners.
